            "detailed_description": "Professional pyrotech Billie Ray has left you in charge of his booming Petrol and TNT business! Your first task: learn how to shoot fireworks and use explosives.<br><br>Let your creativity run wild! Create your own shows using a multitude of different fireworks and explosives. Be extravagant! Line up and connect fireworks in sequence to create extended, timed and beautiful cascades of light and sound in the night sky above. Or, heck, just blow stuff up!<br><br>In <strong>Sandbox mode</strong> you will have access to a warehouse full of explosives and pyrotechnics, and a private backyard where you can go nuts without anyone bothering you. How crazy can you get?<br><br><strong>NOT YET AVAILABLE:</strong> In <strong>Career mode</strong> you will take on missions as a professional pyrotechnician and explosives expert: build fireworks shows, execute concert and event pyro, and plan, plant and detonate explosives in various other settings and locations.<i> (Career mode will be added when the game is leaves &quot;Early Access&quot;.)</i><br><br><i>Supports HTC Vive and Oculus Rift+Touch.</i>",
