                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not bad for starters.  Some suggestions to the developer: \n\n1) Movement for something like this should be kept to a minimum.  Setting things up requires way too much movement.  Provide a menu and let us spawn the things we want instead of roaming around trying to find fireworks.  It gets too frustrating and doesnt add anything to the experience\n\n2) Once a design has been set up (and saved), lets add some music!\n\n3) Provide some kind of spectator system so that you can instantly go off a distance and watch the show.  Too  much looking straight up.\n\nCreating a fireworks display (especially to music) in of itself is a terrific concept.  Focus on that, and less on the pointless mechanics that just get tiresome.  Hoping to see this evolve more.  Good luck!  I recommend it because the dev has the foundation for a great product.",
